# Offline fictional balances, dummy signature, fixture HTTP response. Never a real wallet/order.
fold folded
rotate portrait
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.hunch
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.hunch/.MainActivity --es tradeFixture demo
wait 5000
expect FICTIONAL TEST ORDER
scrollto Limit price
tap Limit price
type 0.5
key BACK
scrollto Exact number
tap Exact number
type 20
key BACK
scrollto Review order
tap Review order
wait 1500
expect Review order
expect Maximum debit / loss
expect 10.007
shot hunch-order-cover-review
tap Back
scrollto Review order
tap Review order
tap Confirm
wait 3000
scrollto Filled
expect Filled
shot hunch-order-cover-result
fold open
rotate landscape
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.hunch
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.hunch/.MainActivity --es tradeFixture demo
wait 5000
expect FICTIONAL TEST ORDER
scrollto IOC
tap IOC
tap Limit · rests until filled or cancelled
scrollto Limit price
tap Limit price
type 0.5
key BACK
scrollto Exact number
tap Exact number
type 20
key BACK
scrollto Review order
tap Review order
wait 1500
expect Confirm
shot hunch-order-unfolded-review
tap Confirm
wait 2000
scrollto Resting
expect Resting
shot hunch-order-unfolded-resting
swipe 0.5 0.35 0.5 0.85
scrollto Cancel resting order
tap Cancel resting order
expect Confirm cancel
tap Confirm cancel
wait 2500
scrollto Cancelled
expect Cancelled
shot hunch-order-unfolded-cancelled
[phone] Owner opens an actual chosen market, enters the exact action/size/price, checks embedded wallet and network, reads fee ceiling/max loss and confirms/signs himself only. Owner funds wallet. Agents never tap Confirm for a live wallet. Check actual order status by cloid before any subsequent order; unclear result must never be retried. Real-wallet signing and funded testnet acceptance are not covered by emulator fixture.
